{"ID":"20260206210732-yz01rs2","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yz01rs2","title":"一文搞懂YOLO系列目标检测！万字长文（附YOLOv8实操教程）","type":"doc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-krctlhu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-krctlhu","updated":"20260206210732"}},{"ID":"20260206210732-n9khpvr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-n9khpvr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-p9o93i1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-p9o93i1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ghd585c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ghd585c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一文搞懂YOLO系列目标检测！万字长文（附YOLOv8实操教程）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fbde2c1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fbde2c1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-z4pu48p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-z4pu48p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://blog.csdn.net/HUANGXIN9898/article/details/150222920","TextMarkTextContent":"https://blog.csdn.net/HUANGXIN9898/article/details/150222920"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-02c0xu6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-02c0xu6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-bkc2tgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bkc2tgw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文章浏览阅读1.3w次，点赞21次，收藏87次。在当今的计算机视觉领域，目标检测技术扮演着至关重要的角色，随着深度学习技术的迅速发展，目标检测在安防监控、自动驾驶、医疗影像等多个领域得到了广泛应用。传统的目标检测方法通常需要复杂的手工特征设计和分类器训练，不仅效率较低，还存在难以推广的瓶颈。近年来，基于卷积神经网络（CNN）的目标检测方法，尤其是YOLO（You Only Look Once），彻底改变了这一现状。_yolo"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-595u91g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-595u91g","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lo6owcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lo6owcg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2026-02-06 21:07"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-vl9hwni","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vl9hwni","updated":"20260206210732"}},{"ID":"20260206210732-4m2hb5u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4m2hb5u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一文搞懂YOLO系列目标检测！万字长文（附YOLOv8实操教程）"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-xvfkhaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xvfkhaw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/a475fb17e1d34de0869d6316b8a4a43d-20260206210732-rubi76x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"                                                                                      九章云极普惠算力                              文章已被社区收录"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-tz0pqvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tz0pqvx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkTextContent":"加入社区"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7712514","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7712514","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该文章已生成可运行项目，"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-svhrvgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-svhrvgg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"目录"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-mpuajhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mpuajhm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一、引言"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9toerxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9toerxu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 背景介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-5wo0x95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5wo0x95","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的起源"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4wx4q6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4wx4q6p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 文章目的"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-us7pnlb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-us7pnlb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 二、什么是YOLO？"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-b8cg7rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b8cg7rx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的基本概念"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-sr3l5cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-sr3l5cm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的发展历程"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-hbae4u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hbae4u2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 三、YOLO的技术基础"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-59aocr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-59aocr5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的工作原理"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fgsin35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fgsin35","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 核心技术概述"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-067zkym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-067zkym","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 模型结构细节"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3thsdbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3thsdbz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 四、YOLO的实现与训练——从基础到进阶"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3eyu3dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3eyu3dw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://so.csdn.net/so/search?q=%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA\u0026amp;spm=1001.2101.3001.7020","TextMarkTextContent":"环境搭建"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与预训练模型使用"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-umnvx8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-umnvx8i","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 练习1：环境配置与运行预训练模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-mdx4zqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mdx4zqj","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 自定义训练与模型优化"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-pelputp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pelputp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 练习2：标注自定义数据集并训练YOLO模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-l39flbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-l39flbt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 练习3：模型评估与优化"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yn6p7jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yn6p7jn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在不同环境中的部署与测试"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nvt5ixh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nvt5ixh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 练习4：优化和部署YOLO模型到移动设备"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-1j7reik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1j7reik","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 五、YOLO的未来与持续学习"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-djgjdce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-djgjdce","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的优势与挑战"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9chrmk8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9chrmk8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 未来发展方向"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-u6xxn7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u6xxn7p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 持续学习建议"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-pwr3qsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pwr3qsc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 六、结论"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-8hnb87s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8hnb87s","updated":"20260206210732"}},{"ID":"20260206210732-vrm7eg7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vrm7eg7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、引言"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-exyvnmv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-exyvnmv","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"背景介绍"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-h4ss7si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-h4ss7si","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在当今的计算机视觉领域，目标检测技术扮演着至关重要的角色，随着深度学习技术的迅速发展，目标检测在安防监控、自动驾驶、医疗影像等多个领域得到了广泛应用。传统的目标检测方法通常需要复杂的手工特征设计和分类器训练，不仅效率较低，还存在难以推广的瓶颈。近年来，基于卷积神经网络（CNN）的目标检测方法，尤其是YOLO（You Only Look Once），彻底改变了这一现状。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-gzudmjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gzudmjn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO作为一种单阶段目标检测器，能够在一次前向传播中完成图像中所有目标的检测与分类任务，相比于其他两阶段的目标检测方法，如Faster R-CNN，YOLO的实时性和检测效率显得尤为突出。正因如此，YOLO迅速成为了实时目标检测领域的主流方法，并在多个应用场景中得到了成功实践。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-flkk2ur","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-flkk2ur","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLO的起源"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2x94ku4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2x94ku4","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO最早由Joseph Redmon等人在2016年提出，旨在解决目标检测过程中速度和精度之间的平衡问题。传统的目标检测方法，如R-CNN、Fast R-CNN，虽然在检测精度上表现优异，但由于其两阶段的检测流程，导致处理速度较慢，难以满足实时应用的需求。YOLO则通过将整个检测过程简化为单一的回归问题，从而显著提升了检测速度，具体来说，YOLO模型通过一次前向传播即可同时预测出目标的类别和位置，这种高效的设计使得YOLO在目标检测领域中占据了重要地位。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-y26qiuc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-y26qiuc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文章目的"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-rp1dtq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rp1dtq3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本教程的目的是为那些对YOLO尚不了解的开发者提供一个系统性的学习路径，从基础概念到复杂应用，通过一系列循序渐进的实操练习，帮助读者逐步掌握YOLO的各项技术与应用，最终能够熟练运用YOLO进行目标检测项目开发。文章将覆盖从YOLO的安装配置、基本使用、模型训练、优化，到复杂场景的实际应用，以及如何在不同硬件环境中部署YOLO模型。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-cmy7aq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cmy7aq5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通过本教程，读者将能够："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-xxrypnq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xxrypnq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-l5hon0y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-l5hon0y","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qo4z2fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qo4z2fg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深入理解YOLO的基本概念、架构和工作原理。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-eqc0cz0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-eqc0cz0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-v8oages","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v8oages","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熟练使用YOLO的预训练模型进行目标检测。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-eiipds4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-eiipds4","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xfhfdlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xfhfdlk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学会如何使用自定义数据集训练YOLO模型，并掌握模型优化的技巧。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-k3464v7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-k3464v7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-986urus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-986urus","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"掌握YOLO在实际项目中的应用，并能够解决常见的技术问题和挑战。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qg5zqi9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qg5zqi9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二、什么是YOLO？"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-bxiurin","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bxiurin","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLO的基本概念"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-e7dqwwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-e7dqwwk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO，即You Only Look Once，是一种基于深度学习的实时目标检测算法，其核心理念在于将目标检测任务转化为一个单一的回归问题，从输入图像直接预测目标的类别和边界框。YOLO的关键在于其单阶段的设计，这与传统的两阶段检测器形成鲜明对比，两阶段检测器，如Faster R-CNN，首先生成候选区域，然后对这些区域进行分类和边界框回归，虽然这种方法在精度上有优势，但速度相对较慢。YOLO的设计简化了这一流程，使得目标检测的速度得到了极大的提升。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-uz8v7rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uz8v7rk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://so.csdn.net/so/search?q=YOLO%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95\u0026amp;spm=1001.2101.3001.7020","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLO算法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将图像分成S×S的网格，每个网格负责预测一定数量的边界框以及这些框内物体的置信度和类别，通过一次性完成检测和分类，YOLO在速度上远远超过了以往的目标检测方法，特别是在实时应用中表现尤为出色。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-bhrjjyf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bhrjjyf","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLO的发展历程"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-dpxu5nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dpxu5nx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 自2016年YOLOv1问世以来，YOLO算法经历了多次迭代，每一版本都在精度、速度、模型结构等方面有了显著的改进。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-hfwvb9q","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hfwvb9q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qfao488","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qfao488","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-i531tfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-i531tfu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的初代版本，提出了将目标检测简化为回归问题的创新思路。YOLOv1通过一次前向传播即可完成目标检测，但在处理小目标时表现不佳，且检测的精度在复杂场景中有所欠缺。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6ulxxzw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6ulxxzw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lag090u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lag090u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv2（YOLO9000）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在YOLOv1的基础上，YOLOv2引入了批归一化（Batch Normalization）、Anchor Boxes等技术，极大地提高了模型的稳定性和检测精度。YOLOv2还能够同时在ImageNet和COCO数据集上进行训练，实现了对多种目标类别的检测。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-480aw4e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-480aw4e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-wxdytjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-wxdytjn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLOv3引入了一个新的特征提取网络Darknet-53，并采用了多尺度检测方法，使得模型在不同大小的目标检测上表现更为出色。此外，YOLOv3在检测速度和精度之间达到了良好的平衡，成为了当时的主流检测算法。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-p9cxxr0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-p9cxxr0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-pjkl351","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pjkl351","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLOv4结合了诸如CSPNet、Mish激活函数等最新的网络结构与优化方法，在保证检测速度的同时进一步提高了精度。YOLOv4在速度和精度上取得了显著的进步，并且兼顾了硬件资源的有效利用。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6mf0m7e","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6mf0m7e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-72brsgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-72brsgs","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：虽然YOLOv5并非由YOLO的原作者发布，但由于其在易用性和性能上的出色表现，迅速成为了开发者们的首选。YOLOv5采用了PyTorch框架实现，并在推理速度和精度上取得了很好的平衡，是实际应用中广泛使用的版本。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-tsmsmkm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tsmsmkm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qlji8lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qlji8lu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLOv9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：作为YOLO的最新版本，YOLOv9专注于模型的效率优化，推出了GELAN（General Efficient Layer Aggregation Network）和PGI（Programmable Gradient Information）等创新技术。这些改进使得YOLOv9能够在保持高精度的同时进一步降低计算量和模型大小，适应更多的实际应用场景。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2dywz6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2dywz6q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO系列模型的发展历程展示了从简单到复杂，从基础到优化的技术演进，每个版本的更新都带来了性能的提升，并扩展了YOLO在不同场景中的应用潜力。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4krd97s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4krd97s","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三、YOLO的技术基础"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-txiyzjo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-txiyzjo","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLO的工作原理"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-q8pd36z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q8pd36z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO的工作原理基于将目标检测任务转化为一个回归问题。具体来说，YOLO模型将输入图像划分为S×S的网格，每个网格单元负责预测多个边界框及其对应的类别置信度，模型的输出是一系列边界框、类别标签以及对应的置信度分数。YOLO通过一次性处理整个图像，生成所有目标的检测结果，这种方法显著提高了检测速度。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-wizhiix","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-wizhiix","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-oei2t8u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-oei2t8u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xst9e64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xst9e64","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入与输出"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的输入通常是一个固定尺寸的图像（例如416×416像素），而输出则是一个包含边界框坐标、类别标签和置信度的张量。每个网格单元预测多个边界框，并为每个边界框生成一个置信度分数和类别预测。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9ii406w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9ii406w","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j1l86jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j1l86jh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"网络架构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的核心架构是一个卷积神经网络（CNN），通常包括多层卷积、池化和全连接层。YOLOv1使用了一个简单的卷积网络，而后续版本（如YOLOv3、YOLOv4）则引入了更复杂的特征提取器（如Darknet-53、CSPNet）以提高检测精度。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7k4hpdd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7k4hpdd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心技术概述"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9t578gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9t578gx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO采用了一系列关键技术来实现高效的目标检测："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-owet6hg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-owet6hg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j5xa9cj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j5xa9cj","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-n9j1yk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-n9j1yk1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Anchor Boxes"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：Anchor boxes是一种预定义的边界框集合，用于处理不同大小和形状的目标，YOLO模型在每个网格单元上预设多个anchor boxes，并为每个box预测其偏移量和类别，这种设计允许YOLO在处理多尺度目标时更加灵活。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ye58mn9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ye58mn9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xbd65e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xbd65e6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"损失函数与优化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的损失函数包括位置误差、置信度误差和类别误差的组合，通过优化这些误差，YOLO模型能够在训练过程中不断提高预测精度。具体而言，YOLO的损失函数会在模型训练时对预测的边界框位置、类别置信度和分类结果进行综合评估，从而指导模型参数的更新。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-8c73bbx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8c73bbx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-vk97fe3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vk97fe3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Non-Maximum Suppression (NMS)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：NMS是一种后处理技术，用于消除多个重叠的边界框，保留置信度最高的那个，这一过程能够有效减少检测结果中的冗余和重复，提高检测结果的准确性。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ijozmb5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ijozmb5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模型结构细节"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-kyglhpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-kyglhpm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO模型的结构设计非常灵活，以适应不同的硬件和应用场景需求。早期的YOLO版本（如YOLOv1）采用了相对简单的卷积层堆叠结构，以此生成特征图，然而，随着YOLO的不断发展，后续版本引入了更加复杂的模块化设计和特征提取器，从而提高了模型的检测精度和效率。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2w90km9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2w90km9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j8a3x6m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j8a3x6m","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-udl0lz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-udl0lz1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卷积层与池化层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的卷积层用于提取输入图像的特征，通过不同深度的卷积核捕捉图像中的不同模式。池化层则用于缩减特征图的尺寸，减少计算量的同时保留重要特征信息。这些层级构建了YOLO的基本骨架，使得模型能够从图像中提取多尺度特征。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-iz5kf2l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-iz5kf2l","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-1up2n1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1up2n1y","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特征提取器的演变"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLOv1使用了相对基础的卷积神经网络（CNN）结构，但从YOLOv2开始，模型引入了更加复杂的特征提取器。例如，YOLOv3使用了Darknet-53，这是一个包含53层卷积的深度网络，能够在不同尺度上提取丰富的特征。YOLOv4则进一步引入了CSPNet（Cross Stage Partial Network）结构，通过跨阶段部分连接，提高了模型的特征复用效率，减少了冗余计算。YOLOv9中的GELAN（General Efficient Layer Aggregation Network）更是进一步优化了网络的效率，使其在保持高精度的同时降低了计算复杂度。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7madvi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7madvi0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这些架构的进化不仅提高了YOLO的检测精度，也使得YOLO能够在更广泛的硬件环境中高效运行，包括在资源有限的嵌入式设备和移动设备上。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qt6vwse","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qt6vwse","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四、YOLO的实现与训练——从基础到进阶"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ei7rtwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ei7rtwc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本章将详细介绍如何从零开始使用YOLO，包括环境的搭建、预训练模型的使用、自定义数据集的训练、模型优化，以及在不同硬件环境中的部署。通过一系列的实操练习，读者将逐步掌握YOLO的实际应用技能。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ttic2rz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ttic2rz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"环境搭建与预训练模型使用"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7yocx4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7yocx4v","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 要开始使用YOLO进行目标检测，首先需要配置开发环境，并下载预训练模型进行测试。以下内容将帮助你快速搭建环境并进行基础检测操作。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-bsoeryd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":6,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bsoeryd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"练习1：环境配置与运行预训练模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3l2foga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3l2foga","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 安装YOLO的开发环境"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yxoze53","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yxoze53","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-194l80j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-194l80j","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lusm5ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lusm5ar","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先，你需要安装Python以及相关的深度学习框架（如PyTorch或TensorFlow）。以YOLOv5为例，你可以通过以下步骤在你的本地环境中安装所需的依赖项："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yfw7a4z","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yfw7a4z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"git clone https://github.com/ultralytics/yolov5\ncd yolov5\npip install -r requirements.txt\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-xk0ycq2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xk0ycq2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-b86i4sh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b86i4sh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-tmld62e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tmld62e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"安装完成后，你可以使用以下命令检查是否成功安装："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qc3pfsb","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qc3pfsb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python detect.py --source inference/images/horses.jpg\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-u1epzd6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u1epzd6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hgy2czq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hgy2czq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-4jca163","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4jca163","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这将使用默认的YOLOv5s预训练模型在样例图像上进行目标检测，并输出检测结果。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-lw92txs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lw92txs","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 下载COCO预训练模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-avrn1ae","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-avrn1ae","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-zua6qrq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zua6qrq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ajvv9tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ajvv9tu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLOv5提供了多种预训练模型，这些模型基于COCO数据集进行训练，你可以下载这些模型并使用它们进行目标检测。以下命令将使用预训练的YOLOv5s模型："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-60mx6hn","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-60mx6hn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python detect.py --weights yolov5s.pt --source inference/images/\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6yxrsws","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6yxrsws","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-07zayb9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-07zayb9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-6dh8n8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6dh8n8n","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你还可以选择其他模型版本（如yolov5m、yolov5l等），以适应不同的硬件性能和检测需求。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fkl3kzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fkl3kzc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 运行检测脚本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-50i4kil","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-50i4kil","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-8y42bxy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8y42bxy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-n2x468e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-n2x468e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选择一组测试图像或视频，使用预训练模型进行目标检测，你可以通过调整检测参数（如置信度阈值、NMS阈值等）观察不同设置下的检测效果："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-oxm9ul6","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-oxm9ul6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python detect.py --weights yolov5s.pt --img 640 --conf 0.25 --source your_image_or_video_path\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ag387ow","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ag387ow","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ckwfvka","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ckwfvka","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-w9vos0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-w9vos0t","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测结果将保存在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"runs/detect/exp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​目录下，你可以查看这些结果并分析YOLO模型的检测性能。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-g655l3e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-g655l3e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义训练与模型优化"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ncmp7nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ncmp7nw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在理解并使用预训练模型后，接下来你可以尝试训练自己的YOLO模型，这一部分将指导你如何准备数据集并进行模型训练。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-cbkh58e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":6,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cbkh58e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"练习2：标注自定义数据集并训练YOLO模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-gnj8gzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gnj8gzr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为了使YOLO模型适应特定的目标检测任务，你通常需要使用自定义的数据集进行训练，这个练习将详细介绍如何标注数据集、组织数据并进行YOLO模型的训练。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-srhei4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-srhei4k","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 标注数据集"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-i500gcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-i500gcl","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.1 工具选择与安装"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n 标注数据集是YOLO模型训练中至关重要的一步，选择合适的工具可以显著提高效率。LabelImg 是一种开源的图像标注工具，它支持多种标注格式，且界面友好、易于使用。你可以通过以下步骤安装和使用LabelImg："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-v0w5sj8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v0w5sj8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-fhfo3l4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fhfo3l4","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-c1kkd7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-c1kkd7c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"安装LabelImg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2su81n0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2su81n0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-p1x5vo6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-p1x5vo6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hqr3u5z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hqr3u5z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hzr5dh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hzr5dh2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你可以通过以下命令安装LabelImg："}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ydx4sfu","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ydx4sfu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"pip install labelImg\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-bi5sb52","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bi5sb52","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lv5skm9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lv5skm9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-efyz7sr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-efyz7sr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-udai7d0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-udai7d0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-79ok3eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-79ok3eu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"安装完成后，运行以下命令启动LabelImg："}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3zt995o","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3zt995o","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"labelImg\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-rc7b56i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rc7b56i","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-q46mdh1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q46mdh1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-tvgbc1f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tvgbc1f","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-z3c9u6i","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-z3c9u6i","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-w461ve5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-w461ve5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LabelImg启动后，你将看到一个图形用户界面（GUI），可以在其中打开图像并开始标注。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-w4djawx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-w4djawx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.2 标注过程"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n 在LabelImg中标注图像时，你需要为每个目标对象绘制一个矩形边界框，并为该框分配一个标签（即类别）。以下是详细步骤："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-q7pjwd1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q7pjwd1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-8urozh1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8urozh1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-agroxi0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-agroxi0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"打开图像目录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nmnv3iy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nmnv3iy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-9ha1qcx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9ha1qcx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-6we4nif","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6we4nif","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-x65yslw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-x65yslw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在LabelImg界面中，点击“Open Dir”按钮，选择包含你要标注的图像的文件夹，你将看到文件夹中的所有图像文件出现在LabelImg的左侧面板中。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4gjaxx6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4gjaxx6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-7mbx83a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7mbx83a","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"绘制边界框"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-suz7mzx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-suz7mzx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-jhfs1f8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-jhfs1f8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-6rnsr5b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6rnsr5b","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-mrb7hez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mrb7hez","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"点击“Create RectBox”按钮，或者直接按下键盘上的“W”键，在图像中绘制一个矩形框，以包围你要检测的目标，绘制完成后，将弹出一个对话框，要求你为该边界框输入标签（类别名称）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nyl9ib7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nyl9ib7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-dh2str7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dh2str7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于同一张图像中的多个目标对象，重复上述步骤，直到所有目标都被标注。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4rf0bwz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4rf0bwz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-2xuyiux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2xuyiux","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"保存标注文件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3g1vcha","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3g1vcha","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-p7194s0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-p7194s0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-le4w7bx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-le4w7bx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xcawtpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xcawtpz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成标注后，点击“Save”按钮保存标注文件，默认情况下，LabelImg会生成一个XML格式的标注文件，与原图像文件保存在同一目录中。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2xr4aao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2xr4aao","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.3 转换为YOLO格式"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n YOLO模型要求标注文件为特定格式的.txt文件，其中每个目标对象的类别和相对边界框坐标存储为一行，你可以使用LabelImg直接将XML格式转换为YOLO格式："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-kwtj2wl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-kwtj2wl","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-pm30j8j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pm30j8j","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-azxhnjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-azxhnjr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在LabelImg菜单中，选择“PascalVOC”作为输入格式，选择“YOLO”作为输出格式，然后点击“Convert”按钮，LabelImg会自动为每张图像生成一个对应的.txt文件，文件中包含每个目标的类别索引及其归一化的边界框坐标（x"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"center, y"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"center, width, height）。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qeo6lwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qeo6lwc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 准备训练数据"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2owq97b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2owq97b","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.1 数据集组织"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n 为了更好地管理和使用标注好的数据集，你需要按照YOLO的训练要求组织数据集，通常，你需要将图像和对应的标注文件分为训练集（train）和验证集（val）："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-49jlqam","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-49jlqam","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qm60c18","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qm60c18","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5v1qjdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5v1qjdk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"你的数据集目录结构应类似如下："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4op7l58","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4op7l58","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"dataset/\n├── images/\n│   ├── train/\n│   └── val/\n├── labels/\n│   ├── train/\n│   └── val/\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-378yajt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-378yajt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-htye3q8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-htye3q8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-c6cqu7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-c6cqu7a","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用于训练的图像和标注文件分别放置在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"images/train"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"labels/train"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​目录中，将用于验证的图像和标注文件放置在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"images/val"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"labels/val"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​目录中。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4v3vk2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4v3vk2u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.2 编写配置文件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n YOLO需要一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".yaml"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​配置文件来指定数据集路径、类别数量以及类别名称，这个配置文件将指导YOLO模型如何读取和处理你的数据："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-pj743s3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pj743s3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-22g2xs3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-22g2xs3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qszvfr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qszvfr8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"配置文件示例"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2w1xdpg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2w1xdpg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"train: /path/to/your/train/images  # 训练集图像路径\nval: /path/to/your/val/images      # 验证集图像路径\n\nnc: 20  # 类别数量\nnames: ['class1', 'class2', 'class3', ...]  # 类别名称列表\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7ned6vc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7ned6vc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-seznc3v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-seznc3v","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-b96y78p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b96y78p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/path/to/your/train/images"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/path/to/your/val/images"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​替换为你的实际图像路径，确保路径正确无误。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-j4v6kuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j4v6kuh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 训练YOLO模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-0gk82mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-0gk82mr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.1 启动训练"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n 当你已经准备好数据集并编写好配置文件后，就可以开始训练YOLO模型了。使用如下命令启动训练："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-5dzrqpd","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5dzrqpd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python train.py --img 640 --batch 16 --epochs 50 --data your_data.yaml --weights yolov5s.pt --cache\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9zgrew1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9zgrew1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-17nyw7s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-17nyw7s","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-yyuva93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yyuva93","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"参数解释"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-i5aoq5a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-i5aoq5a","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-olke26c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-olke26c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-v9pphfo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v9pphfo","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-f03vggo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-f03vggo","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--img 640"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：指定输入图像的大小为640×640像素。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-n63fc13","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-n63fc13","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-gikt7jt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gikt7jt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--batch 16"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：设置批处理大小为16，这决定了每次迭代处理多少张图像。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-gdg8p0t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gdg8p0t","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-csa7hzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-csa7hzy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--epochs 50"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：设定训练周期为50次，即模型将在整个训练数据集上训练50轮。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-uuc1yx3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uuc1yx3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-yaoxkx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yaoxkx0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--data your_data.yaml"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：指定你之前编写的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".yaml"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​配置文件路径。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-bgs0wfn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bgs0wfn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5oqlxa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5oqlxa0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--weights yolov5s.pt"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：加载预训练的YOLOv5s权重，这可以加快收敛速度。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-8zvgia4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8zvgia4","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-b7flc7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b7flc7u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--cache"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：将数据集加载到内存中，可以加快数据加载速度（适用于较小数据集）。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-pf617gd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pf617gd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.2 监控训练过程"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：\n 在训练过程中，YOLO会生成一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"results.png"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​文件，其中包括训练和验证的损失曲线、精度曲线等。你可以通过这些曲线监控模型的收敛情况，判断是否需要调整超参数或增加训练周期。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-q384o2c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q384o2c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qt6k6n1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qt6k6n1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-2zf91j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2zf91j9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"查看训练结果"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6uyb7wr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6uyb7wr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-v6o5dlp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v6o5dlp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-17xxd1l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-17xxd1l","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-u21js2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u21js2g","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"训练结束后，YOLO会在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"runs/train/exp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​目录下生成多个文件和图表，包括训练日志、模型权重和评估指标。你可以通过这些结果分析模型的性能，并决定是否需要进一步的调优。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6dnpvv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6dnpvv8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通过以上步骤，你将完成YOLO模型的自定义训练过程，并获得一个适应特定任务的目标检测模型，根据任务的复杂性和数据集的大小，你可能需要多次调整超参数或使用更多的数据来获得最佳的检测效果。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7nfy4b5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":6,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7nfy4b5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"练习3：模型评估与优化"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-mbt6bzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mbt6bzt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在完成YOLO模型的初步训练后，模型优化与评估是提升模型性能的关键步骤，通过合理的优化和评估策略，可以显著提高模型的检测精度和泛化能力，确保模型在实际应用中表现出色。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-q13jyjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q13jyjk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 调参与模型优化"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yexuhf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yexuhf9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.1 调整超参数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nysnicm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nysnicm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j3urok1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j3urok1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hrlv59s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hrlv59s","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学习率"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：学习率是影响模型训练速度和效果的关键参数，过高的学习率可能导致训练过程中模型震荡和不稳定，甚至无法收敛；而过低的学习率则可能导致收敛速度过慢或陷入局部最优。通常，使用学习率调度器（如"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ReduceLROnPlateau"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）可以在训练过程中动态调整学习率，以达到更好的训练效果。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fxytyte","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fxytyte","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lcb8p9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lcb8p9y","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"批量大小"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：批量大小直接影响每次训练迭代的数据量，较大的批量大小可以提高计算效率，但可能需要更多的内存；而较小的批量大小则能更好地应对小数据集或硬件限制。通过实验不同的批量大小，可以找到最适合你硬件环境的设置。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-tpdjbvr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tpdjbvr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-zhed6jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zhed6jy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"数据增强"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：数据增强通过对训练数据进行随机变换（如旋转、缩放、翻转、颜色调整等），增加数据的多样性，从而提高模型的泛化能力。你可以通过调整数据增强的强度或引入新的增强策略来优化模型性能。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qtdjrv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qtdjrv1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1.2 使用自动化工具进行超参数优化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-aapbxgd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-aapbxgd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-q6cflxn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-q6cflxn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hsts72q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hsts72q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Optuna"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：Optuna 是一个自动化超参数优化工具，支持多种优化算法，通过定义优化目标和搜索空间，Optuna 能够自动探索不同的超参数组合，并找到最优配置。例如："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-x4yrdq6","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-x4yrdq6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"import optuna\n\ndef objective(trial):\n    lr = trial.suggest_loguniform('lr', 1e-5, 1e-1)\n    batch_size = trial.suggest_int('batch_size', 16, 64)\n    # 定义模型、训练过程和评估方式\n    return evaluation_score  # 返回评估指标\n\nstudy = optuna.create_study(direction='maximize')\nstudy.optimize(objective, n_trials=100)\nbest_params = study.best_params\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-r9hdbzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-r9hdbzs","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 通过 Optuna，可以在大量的超参数组合中快速找到最优解，提升模型的性能和训练效率。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-gbv1zig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gbv1zig","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 使用验证集评估模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-06ud9tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-06ud9tk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在训练完YOLO模型后，使用验证集评估模型的性能是至关重要的，这一步可以帮助你理解模型在未见过的数据上的表现，判断模型是否过拟合，并决定是否需要进一步的调优。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-hlm2xvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hlm2xvf","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.1 验证集的重要性"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4zro6ox","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4zro6ox","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-uxdg15p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uxdg15p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-7gbzeh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7gbzeh2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"过拟合检测"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：如果模型在训练集上表现很好，但在验证集上表现不佳，说明模型可能过拟合，这种情况下，需要调整模型结构、减少训练次数，或增加数据的多样性来改善模型的泛化能力。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-wgxbzbc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-wgxbzbc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-mdmzpfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mdmzpfu","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"调优模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：通过分析验证集上的结果，可以进一步调优超参数（如学习率、批处理大小、数据增强策略等），提升模型的整体性能。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-dkbu2u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dkbu2u0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.2 使用验证集评估模型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fbqynpb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fbqynpb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-nxhw8a7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nxhw8a7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-k9rdvvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-k9rdvvk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"评估指标"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-81oc6n2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-81oc6n2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xme4oq1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xme4oq1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-1sxg3ye","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1sxg3ye","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-8lnvhok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8lnvhok","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Precision（精度）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：模型预测为正类的样本中，实际为正类的比例。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-k3t086q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-k3t086q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ixor1hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ixor1hf","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Recall（召回率）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：实际为正类的样本中，被模型正确预测为正类的比例。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-xsbktyq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xsbktyq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-nmg94ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nmg94ym","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"F1-Score"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：精度和召回率的调和平均数，综合考虑精度和召回率。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9etvn48","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9etvn48","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-uu4wn9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uu4wn9g","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"mAP（mean Average Precision）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在不同IoU阈值下精度-召回曲线的平均值，用于衡量模型的总体检测能力。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-f83ejpy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-f83ejpy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ohdin82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ohdin82","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"查看验证结果"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-h4stg2m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-h4stg2m","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-s5t1t8w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-s5t1t8w","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ca2w6ph","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ca2w6ph","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-woeq74a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-woeq74a","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"验证集的评估结果通常会在训练日志中显示，并在训练结束后保存于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"runs/train/exp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​目录下的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"results.png"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​文件中，该文件包含训练和验证过程中的损失曲线、精度曲线、召回曲线以及mAP曲线。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-z1pvrbn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-z1pvrbn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-rys57xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rys57xn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过分析这些曲线，可以判断模型在验证集上的表现是否稳定，是否存在过拟合现象，以及模型是否达到了预期的性能。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-wa0vaiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-wa0vaiz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.3 调整模型与超参数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-rpokpjw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rpokpjw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-jnyeqma","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-jnyeqma","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-jyz29ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-jyz29ca","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"调整学习率"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：如果模型在验证集上的表现不稳定或出现过拟合，可以尝试调整学习率，较高的学习率可能导致模型在训练过程中忽略细微的误差，而较低的学习率则可能导致训练时间过长或模型陷入局部最优解。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-b8asmo9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b8asmo9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-3iqz2ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3iqz2ex","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"增加训练数据"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：如果验证集上的表现不如预期，可能是因为模型没有看到足够多的变种数据，通过数据增强或增加训练样本，可以扩展数据集，以提高模型的泛化能力。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-tab69pb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tab69pb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ngca9av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ngca9av","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"早停法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：为避免过拟合，可以使用早停法（Early Stopping），即在验证集性能不再提升时停止训练，YOLO的训练脚本可以通过设置"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--patience"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​参数来实现早停，比如："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-rf2mqnq","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rf2mqnq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python train.py --patience 5  # 如果5个epoch内验证集性能没有提升，则停止训练\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-246ja1a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-246ja1a","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-fhqdwk5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fhqdwk5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-cbv8owi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cbv8owi","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正则化技术"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：通过引入正则化技术（如L2正则化、Dropout等），可以防止模型过拟合，提高验证集上的表现。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-t6gerpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-t6gerpb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.4 再次验证和测试"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-u6mppb2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u6mppb2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5hepvj5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5hepvj5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-peum02z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-peum02z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经过上述调整后，再次使用验证集进行评估，观察调整后的模型在验证集上的表现是否得到改善，最终，当验证集上的评估指标达到满意的水平时，可以进一步使用测试集（如果有的话）进行最终的模型评估，以确保模型在实际应用中的表现。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-oc33s82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-oc33s82","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 模型改进"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-48uzi4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-48uzi4j","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.1 实验不同的模型架构"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7yfwv28","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7yfwv28","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-uv3qyam","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uv3qyam","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xmap9fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xmap9fe","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"使用更深的网络"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：如果当前模型的精度未达到预期，可以尝试使用更深的卷积神经网络来提高特征提取能力。例如，从YOLOv5s升级到YOLOv5m、YOLOv5l，或者引入其他架构如EfficientNet、ResNet等。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-k5v3kcj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-k5v3kcj","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5dkzg0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5dkzg0k","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"添加更多的层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：通过增加卷积层或全连接层，模型能够学习到更复杂的特征，但同时也会增加计算量，因此，需要在性能提升和资源消耗之间进行平衡。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-5qe2j2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5qe2j2b","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.2 引入新的数据增强策略"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-cpqp5dt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cpqp5dt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-567mnf0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-567mnf0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5o517gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5o517gf","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"混合增强"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：结合多种数据增强方法，如CutMix、Mosaic，可以进一步增加训练数据的多样性。YOLOv5已经内置了Mosaic增强，可以在配置文件中开启或调节该功能以提升模型性能。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nw3vl0l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nw3vl0l","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-xvvg27l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xvvg27l","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自定义数据增强"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：根据数据集的特点，可以设计特定的增强策略，例如，如果某类目标在图像中经常被遮挡，可以增加遮挡增强策略，帮助模型更好地学习处理这些情况。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-vut310p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vut310p","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在不同环境中的部署与测试"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4k7e04w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4k7e04w","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" YOLO模型不仅可以在高性能服务器上运行，也可以部署在移动设备或嵌入式设备上进行实时目标检测。以下内容将指导你如何在这些环境中部署和优化YOLO模型。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-noxcb6o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":6,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-noxcb6o","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"练习4：优化和部署YOLO模型到移动设备"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-u6mq4f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u6mq4f7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在开发过程中，YOLO模型通常首先在高性能计算平台上进行训练，但为了在移动设备或嵌入式设备上部署并运行这些模型，需要进行模型导出、部署和优化。这些步骤能够确保模型在资源受限的环境中依然能够高效运行，并满足实时应用的需求。以下是详细的步骤和方法。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-trm1d0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-trm1d0h","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1. 导出YOLO模型"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-8weiy9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8weiy9b","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 首先，你需要将训练好的YOLO模型导出为适合部署的格式，YOLOv5等模型通常使用PyTorch进行训练，模型导出为ONNX格式是将其部署到不同平台的第一步："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ey6zuaz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ey6zuaz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"python export.py --weights yolov5s.pt --img 640 --batch 1 --device 0 --include onnx\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-umv7ddy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-umv7ddy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-pdywmbl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pdywmbl","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-e32bqrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-e32bqrx","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解释"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-z07x6kh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-z07x6kh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-cpqr32u","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cpqr32u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-8nq1a1j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-8nq1a1j","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-i06r9sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-i06r9sl","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--weights yolov5s.pt"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：指定要导出的模型权重文件。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9ig7aq8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9ig7aq8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-89uebh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-89uebh3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--img 640"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：指定输入图像的尺寸。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6x3umsc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6x3umsc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-9x70rvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9x70rvw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--batch 1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：设置批量大小。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4mr0v6y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4mr0v6y","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-i7bvx9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-i7bvx9o","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--device 0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：使用设备编号为0的GPU。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-1rhi3ig","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1rhi3ig","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hxmz05v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hxmz05v","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"--include onnx"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：将模型导出为ONNX格式。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-xg6191z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-xg6191z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ONNX格式的模型具有广泛的兼容性，可以在许多不同的平台上运行，包括TensorFlow、TensorRT等。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-wp10fwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-wp10fwp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2. 部署到移动设备"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-mksy58l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mksy58l","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 将YOLO模型部署到移动设备上，需要选择合适的推理框架，如TensorFlow Lite或OpenVINO，这些框架能够在资源有限的设备上高效运行深度学习模型。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-hg30uz9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hg30uz9","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-dgo8aa5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dgo8aa5","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-muh5khv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-muh5khv","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"TensorFlow Lite 部署"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-0xkwgwo","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-0xkwgwo","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"import tensorflow as tf\n\nconverter = tf.lite.TFLiteConverter.from_saved_model('your_saved_model')\ntflite_model = converter.convert()\n\nwith open('model.tflite', 'wb') as f:\n    f.write(tflite_model)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-9zqx1de","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9zqx1de","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-moxa1n2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-moxa1n2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-uzzj3sw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uzzj3sw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-t1ggdst","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-t1ggdst","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-2mxzrpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2mxzrpa","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TensorFlow Lite 是一个轻量级框架，特别适用于移动设备和嵌入式设备，通过将YOLO模型转换为TensorFlow Lite格式，你可以在Android或iOS设备上进行推理，并利用其原生支持的硬件加速器，如GPU或NPU。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-lk2rjta","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lk2rjta","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-uiz3rno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-uiz3rno","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这段代码将模型转换为TensorFlow Lite格式并保存为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".tflite"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​文件，你可以通过编写一个简单的移动应用程序加载这个文件，并利用设备的摄像头实时处理输入图像。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4wbmral","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4wbmral","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-015bjkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-015bjkw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"OpenVINO 部署"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-v05qxx2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v05qxx2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ek11gfp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ek11gfp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-posz376","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-posz376","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-pmam00n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-pmam00n","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"OpenVINO 是Intel推出的开源工具，可以优化深度学习模型并部署到各种Intel硬件上，OpenVINO支持在CPU、GPU、FPGA等设备上运行，并提供了高度优化的推理引擎，适合需要在低功耗设备上部署模型的应用场景。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-zk9mjui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zk9mjui","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 优化推理速度"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-evh6odc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-evh6odc","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在移动设备或嵌入式系统上，资源限制通常是个挑战，因此，模型的推理速度和内存占用必须进行优化。以下是几种常见的优化策略："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-piiwjnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-piiwjnh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.1 模型量化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-alpk9id","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-alpk9id","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-zrw840q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zrw840q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-f7je0yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-f7je0yh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"量化："},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是将模型的权重和激活函数从32位浮点数转换为8位整数的过程。量化后的模型不仅减少了内存占用，还显著提升了推理速度，非常适合移动设备和嵌入式系统。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-b3l0z31","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b3l0z31","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"import tensorflow as tf\n\nconverter = tf.lite.TFLiteConverter.from_saved_model('your_saved_model')\nconverter.optimizations = [tf.lite.Optimize.DEFAULT]\ntflite_quant_model = converter.convert()\n\nwith open('model_quant.tflite', 'wb') as f:\n    f.write(tflite_quant_model)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-cg496a8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-cg496a8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-jeu44a6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-jeu44a6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-10v3u82","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-10v3u82","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-kpwza02","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-kpwza02","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lyvgtsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lyvgtsb","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该代码将模型转换为量化后的TensorFlow Lite模型，这种量化过程虽然可能会略微降低模型精度，但通常对于应用来说是一个合理的权衡。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-rgfbr1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-rgfbr1n","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.2 模型剪枝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-3lotytw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-3lotytw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-0y8zh68","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-0y8zh68","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-m5uojz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-m5uojz7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剪枝："},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是通过移除神经网络中不必要的参数和连接来减少模型复杂性的一种技术。剪枝后的模型可以加快推理速度，并减少内存和计算资源的占用。例如，使用PyTorch中的TorchPruner库可以帮助实现模型剪枝。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yia1kib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yia1kib","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.3 推理框架优化"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ceujahp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ceujahp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-dl75r4c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dl75r4c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-111k5xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-111k5xw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用特定硬件优化的推理框架，如TensorRT和OpenVINO，可以进一步提高YOLO模型的运行效率。TensorRT专为NVIDIA GPU优化，通过生成高度优化的推理引擎，可以显著提升YOLO模型的推理速度和吞吐量。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-yhppjwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yhppjwg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.4 硬件加速"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-23cr7zl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-23cr7zl","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-9gpmu24","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-9gpmu24","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-yikrz7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-yikrz7e","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在部署YOLO模型时，选择合适的硬件加速器（如GPU、NPU）能够极大提高推理速度。对于移动设备，利用GPU加速（如Android上的Vulkan API）或专用NPU（如华为的Kirin芯片）可以显著提升模型的实时性能，保证应用的流畅运行。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-sbp7v52","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-sbp7v52","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五、YOLO的未来与持续学习"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-zz12sos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zz12sos","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在理解并掌握了YOLO的实际应用之后，展望其未来发展方向和制定持续学习的策略对于开发者保持竞争力至关重要。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-tldyb71","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-tldyb71","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YOLO的优势与挑战"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ze1y0k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ze1y0k8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"优势"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-hpcswvr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hpcswvr","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-u0mv8zp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-u0mv8zp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-35r017q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-35r017q","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实时性"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO最大的优势在于其实时处理能力，与其他目标检测算法相比，YOLO采用单阶段检测方法，能够快速生成检测结果，因此非常适合自动驾驶、视频监控等需要实时响应的应用场景。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-0vgogt0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-0vgogt0","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5o12a1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5o12a1x","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"易用性"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO的架构设计相对简单，模型结构易于理解和实现，加上YOLOv5等版本提供了开箱即用的工具和预训练模型，开发者可以轻松上手进行训练和部署。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-dr8zf02","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dr8zf02","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-v26m45y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-v26m45y","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"广泛的应用场景"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO能够在多种硬件平台上高效运行，从高性能服务器到移动设备，均能流畅工作，它已广泛应用于安防监控、无人机、智能家居、零售分析等领域。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ujq8x1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ujq8x1u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"挑战"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-721uftw","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-721uftw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-bfyxq7h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-bfyxq7h","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-hxj6vda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-hxj6vda","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小目标检测"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：YOLO在检测小目标时存在不足，特别是在图像中目标较小且数量较多的情况下，YOLO的检测精度可能明显下降。这是由于YOLO的网格划分策略导致小目标的特征容易被忽略。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-e37alof","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-e37alof","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-skrpgpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-skrpgpz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复杂场景中的性能"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：在复杂场景中，尤其是存在大量重叠目标或背景杂乱时，YOLO的检测性能可能下降。此时，误检和漏检的几率增加，影响整体检测效果。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-nkb5uxy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-nkb5uxy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未来发展方向"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-vpdvmzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vpdvmzk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 随着技术的进步，YOLO的未来发展将进一步优化和拓展其应用领域："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-0owhyn2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-0owhyn2","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-c6zauy1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-c6zauy1","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j252uhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j252uhh","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"更高效的架构设计"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：未来的YOLO版本可能会引入更深层次的特征提取网络或创新的网络架构，如Transformers，以提升检测精度和速度。此外，利用更智能的优化算法来减少计算量和提高模型的效率，将是未来发展的重要方向。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ch8az61","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ch8az61","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-j26rjcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-j26rjcq","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"适应边缘设备"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：随着物联网和边缘计算的普及，YOLO需要在低功耗、低计算资源的设备上实现高效运行，未来的YOLO版本可能会进一步压缩模型体积，优化模型结构，使其更适合嵌入式系统和移动设备的部署。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-377hdnk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-377hdnk","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-6x529vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6x529vd","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"改进小目标检测能力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：针对小目标检测的不足，未来的YOLO模型可能会引入新的检测策略，如使用多尺度特征融合、改进的Anchor机制或专门针对小目标的增强技术，以提升复杂场景中的检测性能。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-zvlzo75","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zvlzo75","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"持续学习建议"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fv45c3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fv45c3u","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为了在YOLO及计算机视觉领域保持竞争力，开发者需要不断学习和提升自己的技能，以下是一些持续学习的建议："}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-4zsd1fj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-4zsd1fj","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-r1zsvil","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-r1zsvil","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qzjstnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qzjstnp","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"跟踪最新研究"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-42p678m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-42p678m","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-ms00q6m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ms00q6m","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qiw263m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qiw263m","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-b54iy43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-b54iy43","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关注计算机视觉领域的顶级会议（如CVPR、ICCV、NeurIPS）和期刊，定期阅读最新发表的研究论文，了解YOLO及其改进版的最新技术进展。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-vfav9pg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vfav9pg","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-vv1jquo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-vv1jquo","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"订阅相关技术博客、参与在线研讨会和论坛讨论，保持对前沿技术的敏锐度。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-dibg6yt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-dibg6yt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-h34v0gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-h34v0gm","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"参与开源项目"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-gzeto3c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-gzeto3c","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-lgn6i0w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-lgn6i0w","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-1iot34x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1iot34x","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-jcnlsci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-jcnlsci","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在GitHub等平台上，参与YOLO相关的开源项目，通过提交代码、修复Bug或改进文档，与全球开发者合作并学习，他们的经验和建议是非常宝贵的学习资源。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-qkwm5p8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qkwm5p8","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-o4d47i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-o4d47i6","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开源项目不仅能帮助你提高编码能力和项目管理技能，还能扩展你的技术网络，接触到更多的实践经验和创新想法。"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fbyhn14","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fbyhn14","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-5hgvq5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-5hgvq5z","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实践项目"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​："}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-mtqty82","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mtqty82","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-mw3mxrs","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-mw3mxrs","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-y23vwc7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-y23vwc7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-thalu47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-thalu47","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将YOLO应用于实际项目中，通过解决真实问题来提升自己的开发能力。例如，尝试将YOLO应用于不同领域的项目，如智能交通、农业监控、工业检测等，积累丰富的实战经验。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ij95xyn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ij95xyn","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260206210732-qun8waj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-qun8waj","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过反复训练、调参、部署和优化模型，你可以逐步掌握从数据准备到模型部署的全流程，提升对YOLO及其应用场景的深度理解。"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-6oxwxco","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-6oxwxco","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六、结论"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-unj24ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-unj24ur","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在本文中，我们系统地介绍了YOLO的起源、技术基础、实现与训练方法、实际应用场景以及未来的发展方向。通过一系列的实操练习，读者应该能够掌握从零开始使用YOLO进行目标检测的能力，并能够在各种实际应用中灵活应用这一技术。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-roopuxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-roopuxy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"YOLO的核心价值在于其高效的单阶段目标检测能力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，这使得它特别适合需要实时处理的应用场景，无论是在自动驾驶、安防监控，还是在医疗影像分析中，YOLO都能提供快速且可靠的目标检测方案。然而，随着技术的不断进步，YOLO也面临着新挑战，例如如何在处理小目标和复杂场景时提高精度，以及如何在资源受限的设备上保持高效的运行。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-2qd9h0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-2qd9h0f","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"对于开发者来说，掌握YOLO仅仅是一个开始"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，在技术飞速发展的今天，持续学习和实践是保持竞争力的关键。通过不断地探索新的应用领域、结合其他AI技术、参与开源社区和学术研究，开发者不仅可以巩固自己的YOLO技术能力，还能推动整个领域的技术进步。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-ml1r7if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-ml1r7if","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 随着YOLO技术的不断演进，我们期待在未来看到更多基于YOLO的创新应用，以及开发者们在各自领域中的杰出成果。愿本文能为你在YOLO及计算机视觉领域的学习和应用提供有价值的帮助，并激励你在未来的项目中创造出更多优秀的技术成果。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-h1uh6i3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-h1uh6i3","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大模型岗位需求"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-zkjr2yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-zkjr2yy","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大模型时代，企业对人才的需求变了，AIGC相关岗位人才难求，薪资持续走高，AI运营薪资平均值约"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18457元，AI工程师薪资平均值约37336元，大模型算法薪资平均值约39607元。"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-1mrz9zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-1mrz9zz","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"在这里插入图片描述"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/9b6606871d2b4fe59961e3f9bd898e2d-20260206210732-6tdw1i1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-isogufw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-isogufw","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 如果你也想学大模型技术去帮助就业和转行，我可以把我自己亲自录制的​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"300节从零基础到精通的视频教程以及配套学习资料无偿分享给你"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​！"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-02rg4hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-02rg4hf","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"在这里插入图片描述"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/1a759efcf9ea4032bc9c17c214c490cb-20260206210732-bkvq1fd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-7vr2es7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-7vr2es7","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 300集从入门到精通的"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全套视频教程\\*"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（包含提示词工程、RAG、Agent等技术点）"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-fttsnpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260206210732-fttsnpt","updated":"20260206210732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"img"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/3b8552135166ed89d34dfa2f119fa942-20260206210732-873afg5.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260206210732-c48ueqb","Type":"NodeParagraph",